      "club_name": "[{\"width\":0.33542975410468606,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.8908794786106338,\"text\":\"From October to March, we had five\",\"x\":0.16561846187148627},{\"width\":0.2673510087624207,\"height\":0.023850521124923696,\"y\":0.870819878829114,\"text\":\"inter-school friendly debates._\",\"x\":0.1188505945955364},{\"width\":0.11320753985716281,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"y\":0.8764534884732327,\"text\":\"The frst one\",\"x\":0.3857442365703704},{\"width\":0.16561843714171276,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"y\":0.863372093172845,\"text\":\"was with Belilios\",\"x\":0.12368973597142165},{\"width\":0.21174004340328817,\"height\":0.013150518957877333,\"y\":0.8604651164623167,\"text\":\"Public School. Girls\",\"x\":0.28721174027424684},{\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"y\":0.8472312700875044,\"text\":\"from B.P.S. were invited to our school on\",\"x\":0.12159329395488247},{\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014683546383140178,\"y\":0.8299418604725565,\"text\":\"3Ist Oct 1969 to speak against the motion\",\"x\":0.12368973191334227},{\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.01608590240975538,\"y\":0.8153094462288948,\"text\":\"“That the money spent on space research\",\"x\":0.12159329395488247},{\"width\":0.37994752239754825,\"height\":0.01886246771299882,\"y\":0.7985832154893956,\"text\":\"should have been used to solve the present\",\"x\":0.12134342029091462},{\"y\":0.7873875005363857,\"height\":0.013887789350379154,\"text\":\"problems of\",\"x\":0.12150380568740816,\"width\":0.11967582379661408},{\"y\":0.789244186285344,\"height\":0.010174418272335228,\"text\":\"the\",\"x\":0.2536687644668451,\"width\":0.04821802822913296},{\"y\":0.787790697900059,\"height\":0.013186500748127994,\"text\":\"world.”Keith\",\"x\":0.30398322502646413,\"width\":0.13417191025454933},{\"y\":0.7824418608019706,\"height\":0.018168604723405424,\"text\":\"Tao，\",\"x\":0.4547525029423164,\"width\":0.04860820393459142},{\"y\":0.7716612379116763,\"height\":0.014675971661794351,\"text\":\"Patrick Law, Andrew Tsui\",\"x\":0.1236897423956195,\"width\":0.2536687411346866},{\"y\":0.7732558142484265,\"height\":0.011760472474734995,\"text\":\"and Francis\",\"x\":0.3794549295942274,\"width\":0.11949685241182462},{\"y\":0.7555913516968745,\"height\":0.01628111053367387,\"text\":\"Kwok represented our school in defending\",\"x\":0.12146271430936688,\"width\":0.37763476080190206},{\"y\":0.744186046806566,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"text\":\"the motion.\",\"x\":0.12159329292280571,\"width\":0.12368972505585607},{\"y\":0.7426710095869242,\"height\":0.013142943615245484,\"text\":\"Miss Lui from B.P.S. and\",\"x\":0.2536687713886666,\"width\":0.24318657029045154},{\"y\":0.7245815406381926,\"height\":0.017559168315477436,\"text\":\"Father McCarthy were the judges. The\",\"x\":0.12138809793302384,\"width\":0.3777226675038952},{\"y\":0.7107491854705773,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"attendance was very gaood and it was quite\",\"x\":0.11949687193194296,\"width\":0.37945490610117294},{\"y\":0.6976744189756403,\"height\":0.013081394655308554,\"text\":\"an enjoyable afternoon. The motion was\",\"x\":0.11949687193194296,\"width\":0.37945490610117294},{\"y\":0.6829744004353262,\"height\":0.013411664186160799,\"text\":\"defeated.\",\"x\":0.1215357748947677,\"width\":0.07768316977672272},{\"y\":0.6526162791266115,\"height\":0.016113362638492168,\"text\":\"We had girls from St. Paul's Secondary\",\"x\":0.16142558747595878,\"width\":0.335429754104686},{\"y\":0.639413680731405,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"School as our guests in our second inter-\",\"x\":0.11949685789618228,\"width\":0.37735849489945905},{\"y\":0.6250000004194388,\"height\":0.013110748564381547,\"text\":\"school debate on 27th Nov.\",\"x\":0.11949685732057283,\"width\":0.26834382050909866},{\"y\":0.6094460548342343,\"height\":0.01596506597164782,\"text\":\"motion was “That the teacher's job is more\",\"x\":0.11933935514569781,\"width\":0.3777229833019755},{\"y\":0.5959302328806791,\"height\":0.013190288108800852,\"text\":\"suitable for women than men.\\\" S.P.S.S.\",\"x\":0.11949687193194296,\"width\":0.37945490610117294},{\"y\":0.5798045599622715,\"height\":0.014672184301121605,\"text\":\"defended the motion while we opposed it.\",\"x\":0.11949685823235004,\"width\":0.3752620549888288},{\"y\":0.5635368245359373,\"height\":0.01689337317252404,\"text\":\"Andrew Tsui, Joseph Poon, George Chan\",\"x\":0.12144135093673171,\"width\":0.37553243556341137},{\"y\":0.5508143323678174,\"height\":0.013139155633286492,\"text\":\"and Patrick Chan represented our school.\",\"x\":0.11949687193194296,\"width\":0.37945490610117294},{\"y\":0.5348534202247686,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"The debate was an exciting one and both\",\"x\":0.12159329585464214,\"width\":0.3752620549888288},{\"y\":0.5201954397538622,\"height\":0.01468828120526744,\"text\":\"sides gave very interesting arguments. Mr.\",\"x\":0.11949687193194296,\"width\":0.37945490610117294},{\"y\":0.5028507742165524,\"height\":0.01756358131135327,\"text\":\"Cheung from S.P.S.S. and Father McGaley\",\"x\":0.1172800075959515,\"width\":0.37761294202544393},{\"y\":0.4912052114472788,\"height\":0.01315525315871846,\"text\":\"were the adjudicators and the motion was\",\"x\":0.12159328925086871,\"width\":0.3752620549888288},{\"y\":0.47817589572584696,\"height\":0.01019619714941955,\"text\":\"won.\",\"x\":0.12159329288418036,\"width\":0.04192871926308575},{\"y\":0.44755700320931124,\"height\":0.016105787295860208,\"text\":\"“That the pen is mightier than the\",\"x\":0.1614255878630614,\"width\":0.33752619401531636},{\"y\":0.43437868613426966,\"height\":0.015225351439236867,\"text\":\"sword”was the motion of the third inter-\",\"x\":0.11731992355388073,\"width\":0.37967056748111183},{\"y\":0.4185667754816206,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"school debate, which took place on 20th\",\"x\":0.11949685490876101,\"width\":0.3773584948994591},{\"y\":0.40260586346696325,\"height\":0.01599878752270434,\"text\":\"Feb 1970. Girls from St. Francis’ Canos-\",\"x\":0.11949685695278613,\"width\":0.37735849489945916},{\"y\":0.3895348840919194,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"text\":\"sian College were invited to our school to\",\"x\":0.11949687382296746,\"width\":0.3773584661905427},{\"y\":0.3749185665443272,\"height\":0.01316282850135031,\"text\":\"speak against the motion. Our school was\",\"x\":0.11949685695278613,\"width\":0.37735849489945916},{\"y\":0.35895765470911045,\"height\":0.013135368272613634,\"text\":\"represented by Patrick Chan, Lawrence\",\"x\":0.11949685695278613,\"width\":0.37735849489945916},{\"y\":0.34297077427838885,\"height\":0.016294716701445444,\"text\":\"Ngi, Jerome Cheung and Mui Kwong\",\"x\":0.1214798277734897,\"width\":0.37549069279897695},{\"y\":0.33127035827772366,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"text\":\"Chiu.\",\"x\":0.12159329378930181,\"width\":0.06498951521664437},{\"y\":0.32703488344978515,\"height\":0.014658927917480469,\"text\":\"Mother Kita from S.F.C.C. and\",\"x\":0.1907756927648338,\"width\":0.30398321286306446},{\"text\":\"Father O'Rourke were the juages, and they\",\"x\":0.12141630411257115,\"width\":0.3714376828183795,\"height\":0.014428509640771248,\"y\":0.3143868257484914},{\"text\":\"decided that the motion was defeated.\",\"x\":0.11938658457590921,\"width\":0.3377466210753763,\"height\":0.014620813872992744,\"y\":0.2993708594692537},{\"text\":\"We were invited to St. Louis School\",\"x\":0.16352202317026768,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.014675971661794462,\"y\":0.2716612374877422},{\"text\":\"for our fourth inter-school debate on 6th\",\"x\":0.11740042790678606,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.2586319218785217},{\"text\":\"Mar 1970.\",\"x\":0.11943258912032065,\"width\":0.09656459345418333,\"height\":0.014948496989396154,\"y\":0.24107226325722075},{\"text\":\"The debate was held in cele-\",\"x\":0.23689728308872376,\"width\":0.25995806086657747,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"y\":0.24418604661276755},{\"text\":\"bration of the Open Day of St. Louis\",\"x\":0.11949685789618228,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.22671009798037478},{\"text\":\"School. It was a mixed debate and the\",\"x\":0.11949685823235004,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.2136627910807759},{\"text\":\"motion was “That it is not advisable for\",\"x\":0.11949685789618228,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013186500748127994,\"y\":0.19902280124885774},{\"text\":\"the housewife to go out to work.” Ray-\",\"x\":0.11949687382296746,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.18168604653118048},{\"text\":\"mond Chow, Paul Tam, Ching Hei Tong\",\"x\":0.11949685135254581,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.16710097706831495},{\"text\":\"and Kwok Hok Leung spoke on the teams.\",\"x\":0.1194968597959419,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.15261627900453323},{\"text\":\"Though very few boys from our school\",\"x\":0.11949685197798256,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.13808139565926436},{\"text\":\"attended the debate, both teams\",\"x\":0.11949685662751873,\"width\":0.3312369029923418,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.12209302329959126},{\"text\":\"were\",\"x\":0.45073375289403206,\"width\":0.044025155585101505,\"height\":0.008814672849077332,\"y\":0.12345276874387423},{\"text\":\"78\",\"x\":0.1153039837049801,\"width\":0.02515723227557437,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.06250000018324686},{\"text\":\"equally eloquent and all had an\",\"x\":0.5429769471946382,\"width\":0.29350104201882943,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.8895348841403691},{\"text\":\"enjoyable\",\"x\":0.8322512023826985,\"width\":0.0860217032517786,\"height\":0.016163716021112218,\"y\":0.8865402352115374},{\"text\":\"afternoon.\",\"x\":0.5429769400518266,\"width\":0.09014675108083325,\"height\":0.01316282850135031,\"y\":0.8749185664825538},{\"text\":\"Father Joyce from St. Louis\",\"x\":0.6352201194441495,\"width\":0.28301887117459434,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.8735465115505603},{\"text\":\"School and Father O'Rourke from our\",\"x\":0.5429769417536247,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.0131505183365912,\"y\":0.8604651166440027},{\"text\":\"school judged the debate. The motion was\",\"x\":0.5408804962609624,\"width\":0.37735849489945916,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.844476744084475},{\"text\":\"won.\",\"x\":0.5408805034443466,\"width\":0.04402515558510145,\"height\":0.010423452458086513,\"y\":0.8312703585046596},{\"text\":\"St. Paul's College invited us for our\",\"x\":0.5849056722139042,\"width\":0.3354297541046861,\"height\":0.013126846089813515,\"y\":0.802280130362114},{\"text\":\"fifth inter-school debate. The debate took\",\"x\":0.5429769397662425,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013186500748127994,\"y\":0.7877906978031597},{\"text\":\"place in our school hall on 20th Mar 1970\",\"x\":0.5408804966495411,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.7732558141791287},{\"text\":\"and\",\"x\":0.5387840667469009,\"width\":0.03563941388565306,\"height\":0.013170403843982159,\"y\":0.7586319215214627},{\"text\":\"the motion\",\"x\":0.5890985324713339,\"width\":0.12578616496648642,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"y\":0.7601744188995891},{\"text\":\"waS\",\"x\":0.7190775698246448,\"width\":0.03773584661905427,\"height\":0.008880955699212434,\"y\":0.7601744189085018},{\"text\":\"“That\",\"x\":0.7693920342611444,\"width\":0.05870020625059713,\"height\":0.013170403222695914,\"y\":0.7586319220361598},{\"text\":\"corporal\",\"x\":0.8301512609411786,\"width\":0.08812514813800854,\"height\":0.011902128834677783,\"y\":0.7571303308876215},{\"text\":\"punishment in schools should be abolished.”\",\"x\":0.5387840756076944,\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.7426710099173358},{\"text\":\"We were on the Government and St. Paul's\",\"x\":0.5429769420897924,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013090864299562965,\"y\":0.7296416935295448},{\"text\":\"College, the Opposition. Our school was\",\"x\":0.542976934324244,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014675971661794462,\"y\":0.7136627908504635},{\"text\":\"represented by Joseph Poon, Huang Hsing\",\"x\":0.5405927180992373,\"width\":0.37797102833960483,\"height\":0.02011525405734682,\"y\":0.6955315734717112},{\"text\":\"and Steve Lee. Mr. McAllister from St.\",\"x\":0.540880507594684,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013126846089813515,\"y\":0.6845930236207469},{\"x\":0.5387840820909229,\"y\":0.6656976749172945,\"text\":\"Paul's College and Father MeGaley were\",\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"height\":0.01744185954041111},{\"x\":0.538784074476776,\"y\":0.6540697678128496,\"text\":\"the adjudicators.\",\"width\":0.15094338647621708,\"height\":0.013081394655308443},{\"x\":0.7044025203761156,\"y\":0.6540697677704563,\"text\":\"The motion was won.\",\"width\":0.19287211291653195,\"height\":0.013081394655308332},{\"x\":0.5849056755025527,\"y\":0.6250000000195526,\"text\":\"On the whole, the society had a\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"x\":0.538596876767578,\"y\":0.6082466797546924,\"text\":\"fairly active and successful year, with five\",\"width\":0.3777694056197818,\"height\":0.019151641646891537},{\"x\":0.538784068692828,\"y\":0.5973837213206016,\"text\":\"inter-school debates and seven inter-class\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013081394655308443},{\"x\":0.5408805065464661,\"y\":0.5798045603534221,\"text\":\"ones, a total of twelve debates. Though we\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.01467218367983536},{\"x\":0.5387840696362242,\"y\":0.5683139535895116,\"text\":\"must admit that we lost most of our inter-\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.011627906774464902},{\"x\":0.5387840729843935,\"y\":0.5508143319679312,\"text\":\"school debates, we found that we all gained\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.540880508856876,\"y\":0.5363372092734285,\"text\":\"precious experience from them.\",\"width\":0.27882599135333375,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"x\":0.8322505113660968,\"y\":0.5347876085203951,\"text\":\"We plan-\",\"width\":0.08392664854636422,\"height\":0.014727108486312201},{\"x\":0.5408805066565289,\"y\":0.5231270357731703,\"text\":\"ned to organize more debates after the\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.011756685114062249},{\"x\":0.5408805056949245,\"y\":0.5071661235295886,\"text\":\"Easter Holidays, but because of the Ma-\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013182713387455136},{\"x\":0.5387840836719849,\"y\":0.4941368078175896,\"text\":\"triculation and School Certificate Examina-\",\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.011726384364820763},{\"x\":0.5385823438307121,\"y\":0.47556116959358596,\"text\":\"tions, we just had to give them up.\",\"width\":0.30860520485764054,\"height\":0.01669302204144507},{\"x\":0.844863733798,\"y\":0.4796511631264292,\"text\":\"It was\",\"width\":0.07127882059407709,\"height\":0.010251116985606878},{\"x\":0.538784068692828,\"y\":0.46220930235482394,\"text\":\"indeed a pity that we could not finish the\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014663662118321485},{\"x\":0.5387840696362242,\"y\":0.44622093027633547,\"text\":\"finals of the inter-class debating competi-\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014691121725772027},{\"x\":0.5387840833284352,\"y\":0.4315960911720743,\"text\":\"tion; however, we found out later in\",\"width\":0.34800836485955133,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.8867924531892724,\"y\":0.43452768733933056,\"text\":\"the\",\"width\":0.02935010312529862,\"height\":0.010239754282302171},{\"x\":0.5385767379898881,\"y\":0.41708529139065476,\"text\":\"year that the lower forms were also in-\",\"width\":0.3776854607482508,\"height\":0.01711043814494484},{\"x\":0.5384999386312166,\"y\":0.3993947276176214,\"text\":\"terested in debating. So we hope that next\",\"width\":0.38000476797683447,\"height\":0.020374342828309522},{\"x\":0.5387840696362242,\"y\":0.387947882588383,\"text\":\"year, we shall be able to organize debates\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013355048859934882},{\"x\":0.5385476069703377,\"y\":0.3718738493808432,\"text\":\"for the lower forms also. We would also\",\"width\":0.37779050667333025,\"height\":0.01746220914859331},{\"x\":0.5387840758495226,\"y\":0.3589576545030225,\"text\":\"like to point out that the attendance of the\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"x\":0.538784068692828,\"y\":0.34299674284482384,\"text\":\"debates this year was not too good. We\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013107908043876959},{\"x\":0.5387840731940371,\"y\":0.32703488420413085,\"text\":\"sincerely hope that we may get better sup-\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.01598837165956768},{\"x\":0.5387840680775164,\"y\":0.31237785010636787,\"text\":\"port next year.\",\"width\":0.1320754703439191,\"height\":0.013355048859934882},{\"x\":0.5828092372216305,\"y\":0.28631921851599595,\"text\":\"To end, we would like to express our\",\"width\":0.33333331419405565,\"height\":0.01309938586107684},{\"x\":0.538784069972392,\"y\":0.2703488372530799,\"text\":\"gratitude to all the Fathers who so kindly\",\"width\":0.3752620549888287,\"height\":0.014667449478994343},{\"x\":0.538555156633281,\"y\":0.2530353670644928,\"text\":\"consented to be judges in our debates，\",\"width\":0.3779470276855009,\"height\":0.02135398939300437},{\"x\":0.538784068692828,\"y\":0.24127907018688055,\"text\":\"especially to Father MeGaley who has\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013118323907013507},{\"x\":0.5387840696362242,\"y\":0.22529069764552156,\"text\":\"constantly been giving us valuable advice，\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"x\":0.5386464951144239,\"y\":0.21026239917538725,\"text\":\"and to Father Farren who has kindly seen\",\"width\":0.3755982938176152,\"height\":0.017307144811176678},{\"x\":0.5366876241435621,\"y\":0.1960912053450512,\"text\":\"to it that the hall was prepared each time\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013355048859934882},{\"x\":0.5387840680638972,\"y\":0.181686046664417,\"text\":\"we had a debate in our school. Finally，\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"y\":0.1686046513220698,\"x\":0.5387840705978287,\"text\":\"we would also like to thank the students\"},{\"width\":0.3192463369719396,\"height\":0.01789106748003133,\"y\":0.1491038315466955,\"x\":0.5363829359938659,\"text\":\"for their kind and generous support.\"},{\"width\":0.09443257601891386,\"height\":0.011994313417117763,\"y\":0.12336330872294554,\"x\":0.8217564595010067,\"text\":\"Peter Yew.\"}]",
